(2411, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:00', '2026-11-15 10:41:00', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Hot swap sockets so you can customize with your favorite switches</li><li>Store up to 3 unique Bluetooth devices in wireless mode</li><li>Space-saving 60% layout</li><li>RGB backlit with multiple lighting modes</li><li>Rechargable lithium battery</li><li>USB-C interface</li><li>Includes high quality switch puller</li></ul><p>Meko Blink</p><p>A feature-packed 60% at an affordable price, Meko&#x27;s Blink is the perfect keyboard for those getting into the mechanical keyboard hobby or enthusiasts wanting to add to their MK collection. The Blink features full hotswap functionality, Bluetooth connectivity, RGB Backlighting, Double Shot caps, and more packed into a stylish frame.</p>', 'Meko Blink White 60% Hotswap Bluetooth RGB Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>60%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Tray Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'meko-blink-white-60-hotswap-bluetooth-rgb-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:09', '2026-11-15 10:41:09', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2411', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2412, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:01', '2026-11-15 10:41:01', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Aluminum CNC machined case</li><li>Connect 3 ways- wired with USB-C cable, Bluetooth 5.1, and 2.4 GHz</li><li>Double gasket design with PC plate</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin or 5-pin switches</li><li>1000 Hz polling rate in wired and 2.4 GHz mode</li><li>South-facing RGB LED with 22 RGB backlight settings</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Premium acoustic foam insulation including layers of IXPE and Poron</li><li>4000 mAh rechargeable li-polymer battery</li><li>ARM Cortex-M4 32-bit STM32F402 MCU</li></ul><p>Keyboards with switches have KSA profile Double Shot PBT keycaps, including both Windows and Mac specialty keys.</p><p>Keyboards with no switches do not include keycaps.</p>', 'Keychron Q6 Max Aluminum Hotswap Wireless Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>Fullsize</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q6-max-aluminum-hotswap-wireless-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:09', '2026-11-15 10:41:09', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2412', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2413, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:01', '2026-11-15 10:41:01', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Triple mode - wired, Bluetooth 5.1, and 2.4 GHz</li><li>Programmable with Vortexgear GUi</li><li>Gasket mount design</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin and 5-pin switches</li><li>Silicone sound dampening pad</li><li>OEM profile PBT Dye Sub keycaps</li><li>Wireless mode powered by 2 AAA batteries</li><li>Polycarbonate mounting plate</li></ul>', 'Vortex PC66 68-Key Dark Grey 65% Hotswap Wireless Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>65%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'vortex-pc66-68-key-dark-grey-65-hotswap-wireless-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:09', '2026-11-15 10:41:09', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2413', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2414, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:01', '2026-11-15 10:41:01', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Durable 6063 aluminum frame with double-gasket design</li><li>Connect 3 ways with up to 3 devices: wired with USB-C cable, Bluetooth 5.1, and 2.4 GHz</li><li>Layered with sound-absorbing foams and latex padding</li><li>Supports dynamic rapid trigger to activate or deactivate keys based on travel distance rather than fixed points</li><li>Remap keys, adjust actuation points, create macro commands and shortucts with the Keychron web app</li><li>System toggle to switch between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>1000 Hz polling rate in wired and 2.4 GHz mode</li><li>Includes USB-C cable, USB-A to USB-C adapter, extension adapter, and wireless dongle</li><li>Hotswappable and compatible exclusively with the Gateron Double-Rail Magnetic switches (Dawn, Nebula, and Aurora)</li></ul><p>The prebuilt version of the Keychron Q1 HE wireless keyboard comes with Gateron Magnetic Nebula switches.</p><p>These switches use magnets and sensors instead of physical contacts to process actuations, creating a much smoother keypress without bounce or chatter. The adjustable actuation point is determined not by location but by distance travelled.</p><p>- 40g start force</p><p>- 60g end force</p><p>- 0.1 - 4.0 mm actuation range</p><p>- linear feel</p><p>- 150 million keypress lifespan</p><p>- double rail structure</p><p>**Barebones version does not come with switches or keycaps**</p>', 'Keychron Q1 HE Aluminum 75% Hotswap Wireless RGB Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>75%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q1-he-aluminum-75-hotswap-wireless-rgb-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:09', '2026-11-15 10:41:09', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2414', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2415, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:01', '2026-11-15 10:41:01', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>CNC machined aluminum case with double gasket design and screw-in stabilizers</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Connect 3 ways- wired with USB-C cable, Bluetooth 5.1, and 2.4 GHz</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>KSA profile Double Shot PBT keycaps</li><li>Premium acoustic foam package including layers of IXPE, PET, and latex</li><li>ARM Cortex-M4 chip with 256K Flash</li><li>1000 Hz polling rate in wired and 2.4 GHz mode</li><li>Includes USB-C cable, USB-A to USB-C adapter, extension adapter, and wireless dongle</li><li>4000 mAh rechargeable li-polymer battery</li></ul><p>Meet the Keychron Q1 Max, a full metal QMK/VIA wireless custom mechanical keyboard, upgraded with a 2.4 GHz wireless connection. Elevating the typing experience further, it has been thoughtfully upgraded with multiple layers of acoustic foams to ensure a premium sound quality with every keystroke.</p>', 'Keychron Q1 Max Aluminum 75% Wireless RGB Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>75%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q1-max-aluminum-75-wireless-rgb-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:09', '2026-11-15 10:41:09', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2415', 0, 'product', '', 0),
