(2427, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:04', '2026-11-15 10:41:04', '', 'Meko Blink White 60% Hotswap Bluetooth RGB Mechanical Keyboard - White', 'Màu sắc: White', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'meko-blink-white-60-hotswap-bluetooth-rgb-mechanical-keyboard-white', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:04', '2026-11-15 10:41:04', '', 2411, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product_variation&p=2427', 0, 'product_variation', '', 0),
(2428, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:04', '2026-11-15 10:41:04', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>RGB 5-pin hotswap PCB with exclusive Kailh yellow hotswap sockets</li><li>IXPE switch dampeners and Poron plate foam and bottom foam for sound dampening and comfort</li><li>Gasket mount design with FR4 plate and Screw-in stabilizers</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Detachable braided USB-C cable</li><li>3-stage keyboard stand</li><li>Black top case with white bottom case</li><li>Check out the rest of the Ducky ProjectD series</li></ul><p>This keyboard is part of Ducky&#x27;s ProjectD series. Explore a personalized experience that enhances productivity and reflects your individuality. Leave it as-is or customize every aspect to make it your own.</p>', 'Ducky Tinker 65 ProjectD 65% Hotswap RGB Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>65%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'ducky-tinker-65-projectd-65-hotswap-rgb-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:04', '2026-11-15 10:41:04', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?product=ducky-tinker-65-projectd-65-hotswap-rgb-keyboard', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2429, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:04', '2026-11-15 10:41:04', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Hot swap sockets so you can customize with your favorite switches</li><li>Store up to 3 unique Bluetooth devices in wireless mode</li><li>Space-saving 60% layout</li><li>RGB backlit with multiple lighting modes</li><li>Rechargable lithium battery</li><li>USB-C interface</li><li>Includes high quality switch puller</li></ul><p>Meko Blink</p><p>A feature-packed 60% at an affordable price, Meko&#x27;s Blink is the perfect keyboard for those getting into the mechanical keyboard hobby or enthusiasts wanting to add to their keyboard collection. The Blink features full hotswap functionality, Bluetooth connectivity, RGB Backlighting, Double Shot caps, and more packed into a stylish frame.</p>', 'Meko Blink 60% Hotswap Bluetooth RGB Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>60%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Tray Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'meko-blink-60-hotswap-bluetooth-rgb-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:04', '2026-11-15 10:41:04', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?product=meko-blink-60-hotswap-bluetooth-rgb-mechanical-keyboard', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2430, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:05', '2026-11-15 10:41:05', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Hot swap sockets so you can customize with your favorite switches</li><li>Store up to 5 unique Bluetooth devices in wireless mode</li><li>65% layout with 71 black ABS Double Shot Cherry profile keycaps</li><li>RGB backlit with multiple lighting modes</li><li>Rechargeable lithium battery</li><li>USB-C interface</li><li>Includes high quality switch puller</li></ul><p>Meko Push</p><p>A feature-packed 65% at an affordable price, Meko&#x27;s Push is great for users looking for a compact footprint with arrow keys. The Push features full hotswap functionality, Bluetooth connectivity, RGB Backlighting, Double Shot caps, and more packed into a stylish frame. Available with Cherry, Kailh, or Gateron switches. Also available as barebones, with no switches or keycaps.</p>', 'Meko Push 65% Hotswap Bluetooth RGB Double Shot ABS Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>65%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Tray Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'meko-push-65-hotswap-bluetooth-rgb-double-shot-abs-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:05', '2026-11-15 10:41:05', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?product=meko-push-65-hotswap-bluetooth-rgb-double-shot-abs-mechanical-keyboard', 0, 'product', '', 0),
