(2441, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:26', '2026-11-15 10:41:26', '<p><strong>Createkeebs LuminKey80 MK II Tri-mode Keyboard</strong> là bộ khung bàn phím cơ custom (Barebones Kit) dành cho người dùng yêu thích tự lắp ráp và cá nhân hóa trải nghiệm gõ phím. Sản phẩm sở hữu thiết kế layout <strong>TKL</strong> gọn gàng cùng kết cấu <strong>Gasket Mount</strong> mang lại độ nhún êm ái và âm thanh gõ trầm ấm.</p><p><strong>Thông số kỹ thuật nổi bật:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Layout:</strong> TKL</li><li><strong>Mạch (PCB):</strong> Hotswap 5-pin</li><li><strong>Cấu trúc gắn (Mounting Style):</strong> Gasket Mount</li><li><strong>Phần mềm tùy chỉnh (Keymap):</strong> Hỗ trợ QMK, VIA</li><li><strong>Chế độ kết nối:</strong> Hỗ trợ kết nối không dây đa chế độ (USB-C / Bluetooth / 2.4GHz)</li><li><strong>Chất liệu vỏ (Case):</strong> Nhôm CNC nguyên khối hoàn thiện tỉ mỉ</li></ul><p><strong>Phụ kiện tiêu chuẩn đi kèm:</strong></p><ul><li>Dây cáp kết nối USB-C</li><li>Dụng cụ nhổ keycap và switch</li><li>Tua vít lắp ráp chuyên dụng</li><li>Bộ đệm Gasket đi kèm</li></ul><p><em>Lưu ý: Sản phẩm là bộ Kit Barebones (chưa bao gồm switch và keycap).</em></p>', 'Createkeebs LuminKey80 MK II Tri-mode Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>TKL</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'createkeebs-luminkey80-mk-ii-tri-mode-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:35', '2026-11-15 10:41:35', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2441', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2442, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:26', '2026-11-15 10:41:26', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Gasket mount design with brass weight</li><li>1.5mm polycarbonate plate</li><li>7 degree typing angle</li><li>1.6mm hotswap PCB</li><li>75% layout with a scroll wheel</li><li>Poron foam sheets</li></ul><p>Barebones version includes:</p><p>- top case</p><p>- bottom case</p><p>- weight</p><p>- scroll wheel</p><p>- PCB</p><p>- USB-C daughter board</p><p>- plate</p><p>- foam kit</p><p>- switch and keycap puller</p><p>- screwdriver</p><p>- wrench</p><p>Prebuilt version includes above as well as:</p><p>- stabilizer kit</p><p>- Gateron Baby Raccoon switch kit</p><p>- keycap set</p><p>Gateron Baby Raccoon switches are a long pole linear switch designed to release stronger and return quickly when typing. They have an actuation force of 55g and a total travel distance of 3.6mm.</p>', 'Createkeebs LuminKey75 Aluminum 75% Hotswap Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>75%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'createkeebs-luminkey75-aluminum-75-hotswap-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:35', '2026-11-15 10:41:35', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2442', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2443, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:27', '2026-11-15 10:41:27', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Triple mode - wired, Bluetooth 5.1, and 2.4 GHz</li><li>Programmable with Vortexgear GUi</li><li>Gasket mount design</li><li>Polycarbonate mounting plate</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin and 5-pin switches</li><li>Silicone sound dampening pad</li><li>PCB mount stabilizers</li><li>Aluminum Vortex logo plate</li><li>Wireless mode powered by 2 AAA batteries</li></ul>', 'Vortex PC66 66-Key Dark Grey 65% Hotswap Wireless Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>65%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'vortex-pc66-66-key-dark-grey-65-hotswap-wireless-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:35', '2026-11-15 10:41:35', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2443', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2444, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:27', '2026-11-15 10:41:27', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Gateron screw-in PCB mount stabilizers</li><li>Includes USB-C cable and USB-A to USB-C Adapter</li><li>Hotswap sockets</li><li>Programmable With QMK and VIA</li><li>Programmable knob is included</li><li>Double gasket mount design Includes sound absorbing foam</li><li>Knob color may be slightly different than the case color</li><li>South-facing RGB LED</li><li>Featuring new and improved aluminum case design and steel plate</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS</li></ul>', 'Keychron Q1 V2 w/ Knob Aluminum 75% Hotswap RGB Win + Mac Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>75%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q1-v2-w-knob-aluminum-75-hotswap-rgb-win-mac-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:35', '2026-11-15 10:41:35', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2444', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2445, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:27', '2026-11-15 10:41:27', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Aluminum CNC machined case</li><li>Connect 3 ways- wired with USB-C cable or wirelessly with Bluetooth 5.1 and 2.4 GHz</li><li>Double gasket design with PC plate and screw-in stabilizers</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin or 5-pin switches</li><li>1000 Hz polling rate in wired and 2.4 GHz mode</li><li>South-facing RGB LED with 22 RGB backlight settings</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Premium acoustic foam package including layers of IXPE, PET, and latex</li><li>4000 mAh rechargeable li-polymer battery</li><li>ARM Cortex-M4 32-bit STM32F402 MCU</li></ul>', 'Keychron Q5 Max Aluminum 96% Hotswap Wireless Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>96%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q5-max-aluminum-96-hotswap-wireless-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:35', '2026-11-15 10:41:35', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2445', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2446, 1, '2026-11-15 10:41:27', '2026-11-15 10:41:27', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Aluminum CNC machined case</li><li>Connect 3 ways- wired with USB-C cable, Bluetooth 5.1, and 2.4 GHz</li><li>Double gasket design with PC plate and screw-in stabilizers</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin or 5-pin switches</li><li>1000 Hz polling rate in wired and 2.4 GHz mode</li><li>South-facing RGB LED with 22 RGB backlight settings</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Premium acoustic foam package including layers of IXPE, PET, and latex</li><li>4000 mAh rechargeable li-polymer battery</li><li>ARM Cortex-M4 32-bit STM32F402 MCU</li></ul><p>Introducing the Keychron Q2 Max, a full metal QMK/VIA wireless customized mechanical keyboard with a 65% layout and support for 2.4G wireless, Bluetooth 5.1, and Type-C wired connections. Compact enough for any space. The built-in multiple layers of acoustic foams, combined with the double-gasket design, enable you to experience unparalleled keystrokes while giving a pleasant typing sound.</p>', 'Keychron Q2 Max Aluminum 65% Hotswap Wireless Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>65%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q2-max-aluminum-65-hotswap-wireless-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:41:58', '2026-11-15 10:41:58', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2446', 0, 'product', '', 0),
