(2516, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:16', '2026-11-15 10:42:16', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Gasket mount ABS case with PC plate</li><li>Connect 3 ways- wired with USB-C cable, Bluetooth 5.1, and 2.4 GHz</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin or 5-pin switches</li><li>1000 Hz polling rate in wired and 2.4 GHz mode</li><li>South-facing RGB LED</li><li>ARM Cortex-M4 32-bit STM32F402 MCU</li><li>4000 mAh rechargeable li-polymer battery</li><li>Includes both USB-A and USB-C 2.4 GHz. wireless receivers with magnetic storage area</li></ul><p>The V1 Max is a fully customizable mechanical keyboard, offering both 2.4 GHz wireless and Bluetooth 5.1 connectivity. Its compact 75% layout, gasket mount design, sound absorbing foam, double-shot PBT keycaps, and more take your typing experience to a new level, delivering heightened levels of comfort and productivity.</p>', 'Keychron V1 Max 75% Hotswap Wireless Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>75%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-v1-max-75-hotswap-wireless-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:42:16', '2026-11-15 10:42:16', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?product=keychron-v1-max-75-hotswap-wireless-keyboard', 0, 'product', '', 0),
