(2531, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>South-facing RGB</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin and 5-pin switches</li><li>Screw-in PCB mount stabilizers included</li><li>1000Hz polling rate</li><li>Silicon acoustic pad and sound absorbing foam included</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>Includes USB-C cable and USB-A to USB-C adapter</li></ul>', 'Keychron V6 Hotswap RGB Win + Mac Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>Fullsize</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Tray Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-v6-hotswap-rgb-win-mac-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2531', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2532, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Solid CNC aluminum case</li><li>Connect 2 ways- wired with USB-C cable or wirelessly with Bluetooth 5.1</li><li>Connect up to 3 devices wirelessly</li><li>South-facing RGB LED</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin and 5-pin switches</li><li>Includes sound absorbing foam and case gaskets</li><li>Double gasket design with PC plate</li><li>Screw-in stabilizers</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>4000 mAh rechargeable battery</li><li>Programmable knob is included</li><li>N-key rollover for both wireless and wired modes</li></ul>', 'Keychron Q1 Pro w/ Knob Aluminum 75% Hotswap RGB Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>75%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q1-pro-w-knob-aluminum-75-hotswap-rgb-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2532', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2533, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>CNC aluminum case/frame</li><li>Double-gasket mounting mechanism</li><li>Programmable with QMK/VIA</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>PCB screw-in stabilizers</li><li>Kailh hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin and 5-pin switches</li><li>South-facing RGB</li><li>Includes USB-C cable and USB-A to USB-C adapter</li><li>1000 Hz polling rate</li><li>Numpad on the left side of the keyboard to increase functionality of left hand</li></ul>', 'Keychron Q12 w/ Knob Aluminum Southpaw Hotswap RGB Win + Mac Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>Fullsize</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q12-w-knob-aluminum-southpaw-hotswap-rgb-win-mac-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2533', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2534, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Condensed 96% form factor</li><li>Programmable with Glorious Core and QMK</li><li>Sound dampening foam</li><li>CNC aluminum top case and polymer bottom case</li><li>Feet allow 7° and 14° typing angle</li><li>Pre-lubed clip-on stabilizers (supports GSV2 screw-in stabilizers)</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin and 5-pin switches</li><li>North facing switches</li><li>Diffused sidelights</li></ul><p>Lightweight and linear, Glorious Fox switches are custom-designed with tight manufacturing tolerances to deliver superior performance. Pre-lubed parts give the switches a satisfyingly smooth sound and feel.</p><p>45 g Operating Force</p><p>Fast Linear Style</p><p>Pre-Lubed Parts</p><p>Clear Housings for Bright RGB</p><p>3.9 mm Travel Distance</p><p>60 g Bottom Out</p>', 'Glorious PC GMMK V2 96% Hotswap RGB Double Shot ABS Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>96%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Tray Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'glorious-pc-gmmk-v2-96-hotswap-rgb-double-shot-abs-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2534', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2535, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>CNC machined aluminum body with silicone pads for sound absorption</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3 pin or 5 pin switches</li><li>Connect 2 ways- wired with USB-C cable or wirelessly with Bluetooth 5.1 (4000mAh rechargeable li-polymer battery)</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>Double gasket design with PC plate</li><li>ARM Cortex-M4 32-bit STM32L432 chip (MCU)</li><li>South-facing RGB LED</li><li>Screw-in stabilizers</li><li>Ergonomic Alice layout with left-handed numpad</li></ul>', 'Keychron Q14 Pro w/ Knob Aluminum Southpaw Alice Hotswap Bluetooth 5.1 RGB Win + Mac Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>Fullsize</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q14-pro-w-knob-aluminum-southpaw-alice-hotswap-bluetooth-5-1-rgb-win-mac-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2535', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2536, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Aluminum CNC machined case</li><li>Connect 3 ways- wired with USB-C cable, Bluetooth 5.1, and 2.4 GHz</li><li>Double gasket design with PC plate</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin or 5-pin switches</li><li>1000 Hz polling rate in wired and 2.4 GHz mode</li><li>South-facing RGB LED with 22 RGB backlight settings</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Premium acoustic foam insulation including layers of IXPE and Poron</li><li>4000 mAh rechargeable li-polymer battery</li><li>ARM Cortex-M4 32-bit STM32F402 MCU</li></ul><p>Keychron Q10 Max is a 2.4 GHz full metal QMK/VIA wireless custom mechanical keyboard with an ergonomic 75% Alice layout. Outfitted with a 1000 Hz polling rate, three-mode connectivity, double-gasket design, and premium enhanced acoustic foams, the Q10 Max keyboard combines functionality and aesthetics for maximum comfort and productivity and gives you a high-end typing experience.</p>', 'Keychron Q10 Max Aluminum 75% Alice Hotswap Wireless RGB Win + Mac Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>75%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q10-max-aluminum-75-alice-hotswap-wireless-rgb-win-mac-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2536', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2537, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>CNC aluminum frame</li><li>Connect 3 ways with up to 3 devices- wired with USB-C cable or wirelessly with Bluetooth 5.1 and 2.4 GHz</li><li>2.4 GHz wireless connection with a 1000 Hz polling rate</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>4000 mAh rechargeable li-polymer battery</li><li>Double gasket design with PC plate and PCB mount screw-in stabilizers</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin or 5-pin switches</li><li>Programmable roller with connection mode toggle</li><li>2 layers of sound dampening foam</li><li>South-facing RGB LED with 22 RGB backlight settings</li></ul><p>Prebuilt keyboards come with Cherry profile Double Shot PBT keycaps.</p><p>Barebones keyboards do not include switches or keycaps.</p><p>Both version include:</p><p>- USB-C cable</p><p>- USB-A to USB-C adapter</p><p>- extension adapter for receiver</p><p>- keycap and switch puller</p><p>- screwdriver</p><p>- hex key</p>', 'Lemokey L1 Aluminum 75% Hotswap Bluetooth and 2.4GHz Wireless RGB Win + Mac Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>75%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lemokey-l1-aluminum-75-hotswap-bluetooth-and-2-4ghz-wireless-rgb-win-mac-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2537', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2538, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '2026-11-15 10:42:38', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Aluminum CNC machined case with Southpaw layout</li><li>Connect 3 ways- wired with USB-C cable, Bluetooth 5.1, and 2.4 GHz</li><li>Double gasket design with PC plate and PCB mount screw-in stablizers</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin or 5-pin switches</li><li>1000 Hz polling rate in wired and 2.4 GHz mode</li><li>South-facing RGB LED with 22 RGB backlight settings</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Premium acoustic foam insulation including layers of IXPE and Poron</li><li>4000 mAh rechargeable li-polymer battery</li><li>ARM Cortex-M4 32-bit STM32F402 MCU</li></ul><p>Prebuilt options come with KSA profile Double Shot PBT keycaps and Gateron Jupiter switches.</p><p>Barebones options do not include keycaps or switches.</p>', 'Keychron Q12 Max Southpaw Hotswap Wireless RGB Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>Fullsize</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q12-max-southpaw-hotswap-wireless-rgb-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:42:47', '2026-11-15 10:42:47', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2538', 0, 'product', '', 0),
