(2560, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Gasket mount design with PC plate</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Connect 3 ways with up to 3 devices: wired with USB-C cable, Bluetooth 5.1, and 2.4 GHz</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin or 5-pin switches</li><li>Premium acoustic foam package including layers of IXPE, PET, and latex</li><li>ARM Cortex-M4 32-bit STM32F402 MCU</li><li>1000 Hz polling rate in wired and 2.4 GHz mode</li><li>Includes USB-C cable, USB-A to USB-C adapter, extension adapter, and wireless dongle</li></ul><p>Prebuilt version includes:</p><p>- prebuilt keyboard with OSA profile Double Shot PBT keycaps and switches of your choice</p><p>- USB-C to USB-C cable</p><p>- USB-C to USB-A adapter</p><p>- extension adapter for receiver</p><p>- USB-C receiver</p><p>- USB-A receiver</p><p>- keycap and switch puller tool</p><p>- screwdriver</p><p>- hex key</p><p>Barebones version includes:</p><p>- keyboard without keycaps or switches</p>', 'Keychron V3 Max Hotswap Wireless Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>TKL</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-v3-max-hotswap-wireless-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '2026-11-15 10:42:46', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?product=keychron-v3-max-hotswap-wireless-keyboard', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2561, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:56', '2026-11-15 10:42:56', '<p><strong>Keychron V3 TKL Hotswap RGB Win + Mac Mechanical Keyboard</strong> là bộ khung bàn phím cơ custom (Barebones Kit) dành cho người dùng yêu thích tự lắp ráp và cá nhân hóa trải nghiệm gõ phím. Sản phẩm sở hữu thiết kế layout <strong>TKL</strong> gọn gàng cùng kết cấu <strong>Tray Mount</strong> mang lại độ nhún êm ái và âm thanh gõ trầm ấm.</p><p><strong>Thông số kỹ thuật nổi bật:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Layout:</strong> TKL</li><li><strong>Mạch (PCB):</strong> Hotswap 5-pin</li><li><strong>Cấu trúc gắn (Mounting Style):</strong> Tray Mount</li><li><strong>Phần mềm tùy chỉnh (Keymap):</strong> Hỗ trợ QMK, VIA</li><li><strong>Chế độ kết nối:</strong> Kết nối dây rời chuẩn USB Type-C</li><li><strong>Chất liệu vỏ (Case):</strong> Nhựa Polycarbonate / ABS cao cấp</li><li><strong>Đèn nền:</strong> Tích hợp LED RGB tùy chỉnh nhiều hiệu ứng</li></ul><p><strong>Phụ kiện tiêu chuẩn đi kèm:</strong></p><ul><li>Bộ cân bằng phím (Stabilizers)</li></ul><p><em>Lưu ý: Sản phẩm là bộ Kit Barebones (chưa bao gồm switch và keycap).</em></p>', 'Keychron V3 TKL Hotswap RGB Win + Mac Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>TKL</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Tray Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-v3-tkl-hotswap-rgb-win-mac-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:43:03', '2026-11-15 10:43:03', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2561', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2562, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:57', '2026-11-15 10:42:57', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>CNC machined aluminum case</li><li>75% form factor with split layout</li><li>Use together with the included bridge cable or use each half by itself</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin and 5-pin switches</li><li>South-facing RGB LED</li><li>Sound absorbing foam</li><li>Programmable rotary knob on each side</li><li>Screw-in stabilizers</li><li>Includes USB-C cable and USB-A to USB-C adapter</li></ul><p>Coming in a 75% Layout and a split design, the Q11 helps you to explore the angles and positions that fit you the best. With its full metal CNC machined body, QMK/VIA support, and unique design, the Q11 is ideal for fulfilling your typing needs!</p>', 'Keychron Q11 w/ Knob 75% Split Hotswap RGB Win + Mac Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>75%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q11-w-knob-75-split-hotswap-rgb-win-mac-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:43:03', '2026-11-15 10:43:03', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2562', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2563, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:57', '2026-11-15 10:42:57', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>CNC machined aluminum case</li><li>Connect 2 ways- wired with USB-C cable or wirelessly with Bluetooth 5.1</li><li>Connect up to 3 devices wirelessly</li><li>1000 Hz polling rate while wired (90 Hz wirelessly)</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Double gasket design with PC plate</li><li>Ultra-low-power ARM Cortex-M4 32-bit STM32L432 chip (MCU)</li><li>4 custom macro keys and aluminum programmable knob included</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin and 5-pin switches</li><li>South-facing RGB LED</li><li>Screw-in stabilizers</li><li>Special edition</li><li>N-key rollover for both wireless and wired modes</li></ul><p>Meet the Keychron Q3 Pro, a groundbreaking full metal QMK/VIA wireless custom mechanical keyboard. Along with our many premium designs, including double-gasket design, PBT keycaps, screw-in stabs, etc., it will deliver you an unprecedented typing experience!</p>', 'Keychron Q3 Pro w/ Knob Special Edition Aluminum TKL Hotswap Wireless RGB Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>TKL</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q3-pro-w-knob-special-edition-aluminum-tkl-hotswap-wireless-rgb-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:43:03', '2026-11-15 10:43:03', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2563', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2564, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:57', '2026-11-15 10:42:57', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>CNC machined aluminum case with double gasket design</li><li>Connect 2 ways- wired with USB-C cable or wirelessly with Bluetooth 5.1</li><li>Connect up to 3 devices wirelessly</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Ultra-low-power ARM Cortex-M4 32-bit STM32L432 chip (MCU)</li><li>1000 Hz polling rate while wired (90 Hz wirelessly)</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>Programmable knob is included</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin and 5-pin switches</li><li>South-facing RGB LED</li><li>Screw-in stabilizers</li><li>Includes USB-C cable and USB-A to USB-C adapter</li></ul><p>Meet the Keychron Q2 Pro, a groundbreaking full metal QMK/VIA wireless custom mechanical keyboard. Along with our many premium designs, including double-gasket design, screw-in stabs, etc., it will deliver you an unprecedented typing experience!</p>', 'Keychron Q2 Pro w/ Knob Aluminum 65% Hotswap Bluetooth RGB Win + Mac Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>65%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q2-pro-w-knob-aluminum-65-hotswap-bluetooth-rgb-win-mac-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:43:03', '2026-11-15 10:43:03', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2564', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2565, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:57', '2026-11-15 10:42:57', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>Connect 2 ways- wired with USB-C cable or wirelessly with Bluetooth 5.1 (4000mAh rechargeable li-polymer battery)</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Sound dampening foam &amp; silicone</li><li>ARM Cortex-M4 32-bit STM32L432 chip (MCU)</li><li>Easy-reach switch to toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3 pin or 5 pin switches</li><li>Screw-in stabilizers</li><li>South-facing RGB LED</li></ul>', 'Keychron K10 Pro Hotswap Bluetooth 5.1 RGB Win + Mac Mechanical Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>Fullsize</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Tray Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-k10-pro-hotswap-bluetooth-5-1-rgb-win-mac-mechanical-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:43:03', '2026-11-15 10:43:03', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2565', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(2566, 1, '2026-11-15 10:42:57', '2026-11-15 10:42:57', '<p>Bản Kit được chọn theo tùy chọn không kèm switch.</p><ul><li>CNC machined aluminum case with double gasket design and screw-in PCB mount stabilizers</li><li>Programmable with QMK and VIA</li><li>Connect 3 ways with up to 3 devices: wired with USB-C cable, Bluetooth 5.1, and 2.4 GHz</li><li>Toggle between Windows and macOS with your personalized layout for each</li><li>Hotswap sockets that support both 3-pin or 5-pin switches</li><li>Premium acoustic foam insulation including layers of IXPE, PET, latex, and Poron</li><li>ARM Cortex-M4 chip with 256K Flash</li><li>1000 Hz polling rate in wired and 2.4 GHz mode</li><li>4000 mAh rechargeable li-polymer battery</li><li>Includes USB-C cable, USB-A to USB-C adapter, extension adapter, and wireless dongle</li></ul>', 'Keychron Q8 Max Aluminum 65% Alice Hotswap Wireless Keyboard', '<ul><li>Bộ Kit bàn phím cơ custom layout <strong>65%</strong></li><li>Mạch <strong>Hotswap 5-pin</strong>, cấu trúc <strong>Gasket Mount</strong></li><li>Lưu ý: Phiên bản Kit Barebones chưa bao gồm Switch và Keycap</li></ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'keychron-q8-max-aluminum-65-alice-hotswap-wireless-keyboard', '', '', '2026-11-15 10:43:03', '2026-11-15 10:43:03', '', 0, 'http://localhost:8000/?post_type=product&#038;p=2566', 0, 'product', '', 0);
